    "8 GB 以上。轉錄加說話者辨識時最高約 2.7 GB，4 小時的會議約 4.1 GB（M3 Pro 實測）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8 GB or more. Transcription plus speaker recognition peaks at about 2.7 GB, about 4.1 GB for a 4-hour meeting (measured on M3 Pro)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
