          }
        }
      }
    },
    "m4a 檔案小、適合分享；wav 是 16 kHz 單聲道，適合給其他轉錄工具使用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "m4a is small and easy to share. wav is 16 kHz mono, suitable for other transcription tools."
          }
        }
      }
    },
