        }
      }
    },
    "srt、vtt 是字幕格式，可以搭配錄音或影片在播放器裡顯示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "srt and vtt are subtitle formats you can show with the audio or video in a player."
          }
        }
      }
    },
