    "「%@」→「%@」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” → “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」裡沒有可以用的逐字稿內容": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has no usable transcript content"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「待確認」列出整理時沒把握的人名、專有名詞、負責人和期限。在「你的回答」欄位直接回答，按「送出」，會議紀錄就會依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的勾「略過」。也可以在「摘要」按「編輯」直接改。改錯了可以從「更多」選「復原上一版會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“To confirm” lists names, terms, owners and deadlines the summarizer wasn't sure about. Type in “Your answer” and click “Submit”, and the notes are revised from your answers; check “Skip” for anything unclear or unimportant. You can also click “Edit” in “Summary” to change things directly. To undo a mistake, choose “Revert to previous notes” from “More”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「整理工具」：選 Claude、Codex（需要先安裝並登入對應的 CLI），或填 Anthropic、OpenAI 的 API key。覺得整理太慢，可以在「模型」填比較快的模型，例如 sonnet。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Summarizer”: choose Claude or Codex (install and sign in to the CLI first), or enter an Anthropic or OpenAI API key. If summaries are slow, enter a faster model in “Model”, such as sonnet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「模型與儲存空間」：下載或刪除模型、看錄音佔用的空間。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Models & Storage”: download or delete models and see how much space recordings use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「範本」：內建五種範本；也可以複製一份來改，或自己新增段落與指示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Templates”: five built-in templates. You can duplicate one to change it, or add your own sections and instructions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「詞彙表」：加入系統名、產品名、人名的正確寫法。這對專有名詞的正確率影響很大。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Glossary”: add the correct spelling of system names, product names and people's names. This makes a big difference for proper nouns."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「進階」：填更新網址、檢查更新；有新版時拾音會詢問，同意後自動下載、驗證並重新打開。也可以從「拾音」選單選「檢查更新…」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Advanced”: enter the update URL and check for updates. When a new version is available, Shiyin asks, then downloads, verifies and reopens. You can also choose “Check for Updates…” from the Shiyin menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「錄音」：選錄音來源、麥克風，以及要不要即時逐字稿和說話者辨識。「正式轉錄」可以選 Breeze ASR 25（建議，會參考詞彙表）或 macOS 內建（不用下載模型、速度快，但英文專有名詞比較容易錯）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Recording”: choose the source and microphone, and whether to use the live transcript and speaker recognition. For “Transcription”, choose Breeze ASR 25 (recommended; uses the glossary) or macOS (no model download and much faster, but more mistakes with proper nouns)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
