    "拾音認出這個人的聲音，自動帶入名字。不對的話點一下": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin recognized this person's voice and filled in the name. Click if it's wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：正在打開瀏覽器登入 %@。登入完成後，回到拾音按「重試」或「測試整理工具」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: opening your browser to sign in to %@. When you’re done, go back to Shiyin and click “Retry” or “Test Summarizer”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「停止並轉錄」後，拾音會在這台 Mac 上重新轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper large-v3-turbo），並分辨不同的說話者。逐字稿上點「說話者 1」可以改成人名，整場都會跟著改。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you click “Stop & Transcribe”, Shiyin transcribes the recording again on this Mac (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper large-v3-turbo for Japanese) and identifies the different speakers. Click “Speaker 1” in the transcript to change it to a name; the whole meeting updates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「錄音」開始，或把錄音檔拖進來。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Record” to start, or drag in a recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「開始使用」後會打開使用說明，介紹錄音、即時逐字稿、會議紀錄和匯出的用法。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Get Started” to open the guide, which covers recording, the live transcript, meeting notes and exporting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按工具列的「錄音」（⌘R）開始錄；點按鈕旁的箭頭可以選錄音來源，線上會議請選「麥克風＋電腦聲音（線上會議）」，對方的聲音也會錄進來。已經有錄音檔的話，拖進視窗、按「匯入」（⌘O），或拖到 Dock 上的拾音圖示都可以。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Record” (⌘R) in the toolbar to start. Click the arrow next to it to choose the source; for online meetings choose “Microphone + computer audio (online meetings)” so the other side is recorded too. If you already have a recording, drag it into the window, click “Import” (⌘O), or drop it on the Shiyin icon in the Dock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
