    },
    "轉錄完成後自動整理成會議紀錄": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarize automatically after transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成後，逐字稿會出現在這裡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcript will appear here after transcription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完會自動整理。「摘要」有重點、決議、待辦和未決問題；「詳細」依議題分段；每一條後面的時間點點一下，就從錄音那裡開始播放。右上角的範本選單可以換成一對一、訪談、課堂／演講、腦力激盪等格式，換完從「更多」選「重新整理會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After transcription, Shiyin summarizes automatically. “Summary” has the key points, decisions, action items and open questions; “Details” is organized by topic. Click the time after any item to play the recording from there. Use the template menu at the top right to switch to One-on-one, Interview, Lecture / talk, Brainstorm and more, then choose “Summarize again” from “More”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄時辨識說話者": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identify speakers when transcribing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型 Breeze ASR 25": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription model Breeze ASR 25"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型只需要下載一次，之後轉錄都不需要網路。可以先按「下一步」，在背景繼續下載。不想下載的話，可以到「設定 → 錄音」把正式轉錄改成 macOS 內建（不參考詞彙表）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You only download the transcription model once; after that, transcription doesn't need the internet. You can click “Next” and let it download in the background. If you'd rather not download it, set transcription to macOS in Settings → Recording (it doesn't use the glossary)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型載入失敗，模型檔可能已損壞，請到設定重新下載": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't load the transcription model. The file may be damaged; download it again in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型還在下載，下載完成前的錄音會先排隊，下載好就會自動轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcription model is still downloading. Recordings wait in the queue and are transcribed automatically once it's done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型還沒下載，錄音會先排隊。可以到「設定 → 模型與儲存空間」下載，或在「設定 → 錄音」改用 macOS 內建辨識。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcription model isn't downloaded yet, so recordings will wait in the queue. Download it in Settings → Models & Storage, or switch to macOS built-in recognition in Settings → Recording."
