    "錄現場會議或你自己的聲音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record in-person meetings or your own voice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議時選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」：你的聲音和對方的聲音會分別錄在左右聲道。第一次錄電腦聲音時，macOS 會詢問「錄製系統音訊」的權限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For online meetings, choose “Microphone + computer audio”: your voice and the other side are recorded on the left and right channels. The first time you record computer audio, macOS asks for System Audio Recording permission."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議（Zoom、Meet、Teams）對方的聲音。第一次選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」錄音時，macOS 會跳出詢問，請按允許。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record the other side of online meetings (Zoom, Meet, Teams). The first time you record with “Microphone + computer audio”, macOS will ask; click Allow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
