    "錄音中標記重點": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bookmark the moment while recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中畫面左邊是即時逐字稿，講完幾秒內就會出現；右邊「我的筆記」每換一行會自動記下當時的錄音時間。重要的地方按「標記重點」（⌘B）。需要中斷時按「暫停」（⇧⌘P），暫停的時間不會錄進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While recording, the live transcript appears on the left within a few seconds of speech. In “My notes” on the right, each new line records the current recording time. Click “Bookmark” (⌘B) at important moments. To take a break, click “Pause” (⇧⌘P); the paused time isn't recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
